body:
Hi {{client.firstName}},

Here is the agreement for {{client.business}}. It lays out the build, the monthly fee, and what happens at each stage.

**Sign here:** {{signLink}}

Once it is signed I will send the first questionnaire, which takes about ten minutes.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Thank you for signing. The next step is eight quick questions about your business, most of which you can answer off the top of your head:

{{links.intro}}

That is everything I need to put four designs in front of you.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Your four homepage directions are ready:

{{links.demo}}

Have a look, pick the one that feels like your business, then answer the two questionnaires below. They are one pass each, not a back-and-forth.

- Brand and demo feedback: {{links.brand}}
- Site build: {{links.build}}

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Every page your site will have is laid out here:

{{previewLink}}

The text is placeholder and the image areas are outlined boxes on purpose: this round is about whether the site has every page you need and how each one is put together. Send your changes in one go and I will fold them in.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

Your copy and photos are in:

{{previewLink}}

Read it through, send your changes in one go, and we launch.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

We are ready to launch. The balance is due now:

{{payLink}}

Once it clears the site goes live at your domain, and the monthly starts on launch day as the agreement describes.

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

A quick nudge: the {{questionnaire.title}} is still open. Your answers save as you go, so it is fine to finish it in more than one sitting.

{{questionnaire.link}}

{{note}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

We are set for **{{meeting.title}}** on {{meeting.when}} ({{meeting.minutes}} minutes).

Join here: {{meeting.link}}

A calendar file is attached. Reply to this email if the time stops working.

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}

Hi {{client.firstName}},

**{{meeting.title}}** is on {{meeting.when}}, about {{meeting.hours}} from now.

Join here: {{meeting.link}}

Thanks,
{{site.brand}}
